 "caveats": [
  "The leg-fit carrier requires >=12 astrometric observations per leg; post-2017 comets discovered post-perihelion contribute only the single-fit construction, so the dual-leg subset is the decisive arena and its size is set by observability.",
  "Pure-gravity refit: cometary NG terms are absorbed into the leg solutions; the NG-flag stratum in T4 prices that floor.",
  "d_in_leg compares the inbound-leg asymptote to the joint-fit osculating direction -- the construction the three-leg catalogue record realizes; per-comet sign conventions follow step_123."
 ]
